}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786715089, "id": "28992177513715361", "version": "0.10.2", "version_code": 22194, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28978083238458122"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786714793, "id": "28992125853720527", "version": "0.10.2", "version_code": 22193, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28978083238458122"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786639624, "id": "28981156588150787", "version": "0.10.2", "version_code": 22190, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28978083238458122"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "890547815531463"}]}, "change_log": "Progression Update\n\t*Added new objective based progression system\n\t*Objectives unlock parts, modes, quests, crystals, and customization options\n\t*Objectives make use of challenges using multiple game systems and serve as pathway for what to do for all players\n\nFTE & Epilogue\n\t*Reworked with a new final chapter that introduces combat and Core Siege\n\t*Epilogue reworked completely to explain how progression works\n\nQuests\n\t*Quests have been added to give players guidance in core mechanics, game modes, and the world of Xumia\n\t*Quests can be found in the new progressions window alongside objectives\n\t*Pre-existing Tutorials from the Xumi Instructor have been turned into Quests\n\t*New Xumi Collection Quest has been added alongside daily Xumi Collection activities in the Rift\n\nDuel Auto-Match\n\t*Auto-Match has been fixed and re-enabled\n\nHit System\n\t*Added avatar hit system in the Rift to allow for players to make greater use of hand weapons against each other\n\nPaints\n\t*Added new part and gizmo paint system to allow for all parts to be customized and saved\n\nParts\n\t*Added defense gizmos as a category and added 13 new template defense gizmos\n\nGizmo Saving Restrictions\n\t*In order to accommodate the new objectives and paints, gizmo saving checks for part ownership to allow saving and if a gizmo is saved with paints that are not owned, these will be saved with their default look.\n\t*Saving gizmos with parts not owned will no longer work\n\nStore\n\t*Paints Tab added to store\n\t*2 Paints added through store\n\nGameplay Improvements\n\t*Avatar cockpit position fixed\n\t*Handheld gizmos more accurately track the player's hand movements\n\nUI/UX\n\t*Added support for painting, including a window for the current part or gizmo with a list of all Paints\n\t*Added information in the parts inventory to indicate how locked parts can be unlocked\n\t*Added an info card to parts in the inventory displaying various stats and customization options\n\t*Added a new progression window to display objectives and progression rewards\n\t*Updated writspod topBar level up functionality and display\n\t*Removed Return to BuildPort app in favor of contextual exit button to reduce clutter\n\t*Player health bar display in the Rift\n\nQoL Improvements\n\t*Player Scannables with session options (mute/kick) and sending platform friend request option\n\t*Player Nametags added game-wide\n\t*Added Hybrid Locomotion with new settings options to toggle between teleport only, continuous left or right movement\n\nOther\n\t*Technical Improvements\n\t*General improvements and bug fixes\n\nDay 1 Patch\n\t*Construction Quest Bug Fix\n\t*Xumi Collection Quest Leave Fix\n\t*Reduced xumi audio in the buildPort\n\t*Fixed caching of wristpod brick app categories outside of the buildPort\n\t*Improved Xumi Instructor Progression Window UI\n\nWeek 2 Patch\n\t*PopUp error Fix\n\t*Objective Claim Fix\n\t*Audio Corruption Fix\n\t*Fixed a rare issue where users could get stuck in a ship in the new part of the FTE\n\t*Core Siege stability fixes\n\t*New Paint Added\n\t*New Throwables added to BuildPort and Social Hub\n\nWeek 5 Patch\n\t*Tier 1 Path 2 Overhauled\n\t*Tier 1, Path 3, 4 and 5 removed\n\t*5 New Paints added added (all tier 1 path 2 objectives and tier 2 path 1 objective 3)\n\t*17 parts added as default sets\n\t*Paints UI updated to allow for more paints\n\t*Multiple objective fixes\n\t*Multiple bug fixes\n\t*Multiple performance improvements", "created_date": 1786621621, "id": "28978083238458122", "version": "0.10.2", "version_code": 22189, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "6784970791529351", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "28978083238458122"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1786542154, "id": "28966001652999614", "version": "0.10.2", "version_code": 22187, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}]}}, "viewer": {"user": null}}}